#Finding 1 - August 2025 had the most reviews for Twin Cities listings meaning that people are more likely to write a review for Twin Cities in August. 
#Finding 2 - North Linden is the Columbus neighborhood with the lowest median price per person at $32.55/person meaning it has the lowest middle price per person. 
